 /*
- * Compiled-in defaults. Both are overridden at run time by the "logo_frames"
- * and "logo_rate_ms" environment variables, so the intro can be retuned with
- * setenv/saveenv instead of a rebuild and a re-flash of fip.
+ * How long each frame stays on screen.  The Yocto layer passes its
+ * RZG3L_LOGO_SEQUENCE_RATE_MS in as RZG2L_LOGO_RATE_MS.  The "logo_rate_ms"
+ * environment variable overrides it at run time, so the pace can be retuned
